          "filename": "Tahrir Square, Cairo, in the early morning.jpg",
          "caption": "Tahrir Square (ميدان التحرير), Cairo, Egypt, in the early morning.\nOriginal upload information on Flickr: “I got up at 5 am that morning, when I noticed the sun rising behind the curtain of my hotel room window. Something in the way the sky looked attracted me. Walking towards the balcony of my room, I saw dawn painting a suble orange-reddish band on the horizon. Beneath, the street lights around Tahrir Square were glowing like lava, adding a mystic feeling to the scene.”",
